                  "type": "thermostat",
                  "entity": "climate.ecobee_3",
                  "name": "Home thermostat"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "sensor.climate_ai_ecobee_humidity",
                  "name": "Indoor humidity"
                },
                {
                  "type": "tile",
                  "entity": "input_boolean.climate_ai_enabled",
                  "name": "Automatic climate control",
                  "tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  },
                  "icon_tap_action": {
                    "action": "more-info"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "{% set automatic = states('input_boolean.climate_ai_enabled') %} {% if automatic == 'on' %} **Automatic climate control is on.** It may adjust manual thermostat changes when the next policy or schedule runs. {% elif automatic == 'off' %} **Climate AI is off.** Scheduled comfort and safety controls still apply. {% else %} **Automatic-control status is unavailable.** Check Settings before making changes. {% endif %}\n{% set requested = state_attr('climate.ecobee_3', 'temperature') | float(none) %} {% set effective = state_attr('climate.ecobee', 'temperature') | float(none) %} {% if requested is not none and effective is not none and (effective - requested) | abs >= 0.5 %} The thermostat reports an effective target of **{{ effective }}°C**; the requested target is **{{ requested }}°C**. Utility adjustments can change the effective target. {% endif %}"
                },
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "title": "Latest climate decision",
                  "content": "{% set decision = states('input_text.climate_ai_recommendation') %} {{ decision if decision not in ['unknown', 'unavailable', ''] else 'No climate decision is available yet.' }}"
                }
              ]
