                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "{% set windows = states('input_boolean.night_ventilation_windows_open') %} {% set floor = states('sensor.night_ventilation_cooling_floor') | float(none) %} {% if windows == 'on' and floor is not none and floor > 0 %} **Overnight window policy is active.** Cooling floor: **{{ floor }}°C**. HVAC remains available for comfort while avoiding overnight pre-cooling. {% elif windows == 'on' and floor == 0 %} **Windows are marked open.** The overnight policy runs from **9 PM to 8 AM**. Daytime comfort targets continue normally. {% elif windows == 'off' %} **Windows are marked closed.** Normal comfort targets apply. {% else %} **Window-policy status is unavailable.** Open the control to check its state. {% endif %}\nTurn this on when the **master-bedroom, Izaan-bedroom or guest-bathroom windows** are open. Turn it off when all three are closed.\nThis is your manual selection; it does not detect the windows."
                },
